sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DB as Migrate Working DB
    participant Source as Replicate Source Connector
    participant Cloud as Cloud Replicate
    participant Target as Replicate SAP Target Connector
    participant Catalog as SKP Catalog
    participant Scanner as Scanner
    participant Staging as SAP staging /1LT/*
    participant API as RAP Processing API
    participant Orchestrator as RAP Orchestrator
    participant Queue as Application Jobs / bgRFC
    participant Worker1 as Worker 1
    participant Worker2 as Worker 2
    participant Worker3 as Worker 3
    participant WorkerN as Worker N
    participant Commit as Batch Commit per Worker

    DB->>Source: Replicate migration data
    Source->>Cloud: Send replicated data
    Cloud->>Target: Deliver replicated data
    Target->>Staging: Persist staging records /1LT/*

    Scanner->>Catalog: Request SKP catalog data
    Catalog-->>Scanner: Return SKP catalog data
    Scanner->>API: POST batch reference and scan result
    API->>Orchestrator: Validate scope and idempotency
    Orchestrator->>Staging: Check records and create batch control
    Orchestrator-->>API: BatchId and 202 Accepted
    API-->>Scanner: Return processing response
    Orchestrator->>Queue: Create controlled worker jobs

    rect rgb(49, 134, 46)
        Note over Worker1,WorkerN: Parallel Processing
        par Worker 1
            Queue->>Worker1: Dispatch reserved range
            Worker1->>Staging: Select range from /1LT/*
            Worker1->>Worker1: Create documents and collect results
            Worker1->>Commit: Commit batch
        and Worker 2
            Queue->>Worker2: Dispatch reserved range
            Worker2->>Staging: Select range from /1LT/*
            Worker2->>Worker2: Create documents and collect results
            Worker2->>Commit: Commit batch
        and Worker 3
            Queue->>Worker3: Dispatch reserved range
            Worker3->>Staging: Select range from /1LT/*
            Worker3->>Worker3: Create documents and collect results
            Worker3->>Commit: Commit batch
        and Worker N
            Queue->>WorkerN: Dispatch reserved range
            WorkerN->>Staging: Select range from /1LT/*
            WorkerN->>WorkerN: Create documents and collect results
            WorkerN->>Commit: Commit batch
        end
    end